27
00:05:45,220 --> 00:05:46,220
Full party!

28
00:05:46,220 --> 00:05:48,220
No way, a full party!

29
00:05:48,220 --> 00:05:49,220
That's insane!

30
00:05:49,220 --> 00:05:51,890
I accidentally made a room without even thinking about it.

31
00:05:51,890 --> 00:05:52,820
Oh, I ended up joining!

32
00:05:52,820 --> 00:05:54,820
Oh, it's fine, just come in, come in!

33
00:05:54,820 --> 00:05:55,820
Wait a second.

34
00:05:57,620 --> 00:05:59,620
Mio-chan's cartilage...

35
00:06:00,420 --> 00:06:01,420
Ah, the cartilage...

36
00:06:01,420 --> 00:06:04,420
