37
00:06:04,420 --> 00:06:08,720
If the cartilage is gone, won't the other bones start wearing down? Is that okay?

38
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:11,720
I don't know, I really don't know.

39
00:06:11,720 --> 00:06:14,520
What happens when the cartilage is gone? Does it hurt?

40
00:06:14,520 --> 00:06:17,520
It hurt at first, but...

41
00:06:17,520 --> 00:06:22,520
Humans are interesting — apparently you get used to it.

42
00:06:22,520 --> 00:06:24,520
Humans can get used to it?

43
00:06:24,520 --> 00:06:27,520
You get used to it, so it stops hurting.

44
00:06:27,520 --> 00:06:30,320
So anything goes?

45
00:06:30,320 --> 00:06:37,080
Well, it's not that simple — your body tries to compensate in other areas, so the shape of your hand gradually changes.

46
00:06:37,080 --> 00:06:40,940
That's scary, scary, scary, scary, scary!

47
00:06:40,940 --> 00:06:46,070
Your hand shape changing is wild.

48
00:06:46,070 --> 00:06:49,430
Did your cartilage actually wear away?

49
00:06:49,430 --> 00:06:53,950
Yeah, the cartilage at the base of my left thumb...

50
00:06:53,950 --> 00:06:56,530
It disappeared from playing Splatoon too much.

51
00:06:56,530 --> 00:06:57,250
No way...

52
00:06:57,250 --> 00:06:59,670
IRyS might be heading the same way too.

53
00:07:00,230 --> 00:07:03,190
No no no, it's never gotten that bad for me!

54
00:07:03,190 --> 00:07:05,130
It definitely hurts.

55
00:07:05,130 --> 00:07:07,150
So it hurts at first?

56
00:07:07,150 --> 00:07:08,630
It hurts at first, yeah.

57
00:07:08,630 --> 00:07:10,350
So there was a true Splatoon addict here all along!

58
00:07:10,350 --> 00:07:11,630
That's right.

59
00:07:11,630 --> 00:07:13,590
That was a long time ago though.

60
00:07:13,590 --> 00:07:14,410
Wow.

61
00:07:14,410 --> 00:07:16,110
Right?

62
00:07:16,110 --> 00:07:19,790
