65
00:07:24,630 --> 00:07:26,650
How does it sound on your end?

66
00:07:26,650 --> 00:07:27,570
Audio check, check.

67
00:07:27,570 --> 00:07:31,090
Right now I only have Flare and Korone's streams open.

68
00:07:31,090 --> 00:07:35,270
I've turned it up, but...

69
00:07:35,270 --> 00:07:37,690
Flare doesn't use her cartilage that much.

70
00:07:37,690 --> 00:07:41,350
