71
00:07:41,350 --> 00:07:43,290
Because she uses a different weapon.

72
00:07:43,290 --> 00:07:46,850
So her cartilage doesn't wear out.

73
00:07:46,850 --> 00:07:48,210
Losing your cartilage is...

74
00:07:48,210 --> 00:07:50,810
...basically Mio's exclusive privilege.

75
00:07:50,810 --> 00:07:51,710
Brush? Brush?

76
00:07:51,710 --> 00:07:52,290
No, that's not it.

77
00:07:52,290 --> 00:07:52,910
I use...

78
00:07:52,910 --> 00:07:54,330
...the Clash Blaster.

79
00:07:54,330 --> 00:07:56,270
Can you really lose cartilage from the Clash Blaster?

80
00:07:56,270 --> 00:07:57,130
Huh?

81
00:07:59,850 --> 00:08:01,390
With a brush, I kind of get it

82
00:08:01,390 --> 00:08:02,510
Huh?

83
00:08:02,510 --> 00:08:05,990
