84
00:08:05,990 --> 00:08:10,990
Well, it might be a little hard to understand, but...

85
00:08:10,990 --> 00:08:15,350
The Clash Blaster is super frontline, right?

86
00:08:15,350 --> 00:08:15,930
That's true

87
00:08:15,930 --> 00:08:17,750
It's a left-hand frontline weapon, so

88
00:08:17,750 --> 00:08:21,630
I was constantly switching the camera view with the left stick, spinning it around

89
00:08:21,630 --> 00:08:22,930
Oh, I see

90
00:08:22,930 --> 00:08:24,710
Ah, all that spinning around

91
00:08:24,710 --> 00:08:27,290
Yeah, I was spinning it around like crazy

92
00:08:27,290 --> 00:08:31,230
And then it started acting up

93
00:08:31,230 --> 00:08:32,810
It started acting up — that's bad

94
00:08:32,810 --> 00:08:34,410
The cartilage...

95
00:08:34,410 --> 00:08:36,510
The cartilage, yeah

96
00:08:36,510 --> 00:08:39,930
But it's good that your hand shape changed

97
00:08:39,930 --> 00:08:42,890
No no no, it hasn't changed

98
00:08:42,890 --> 00:08:44,170
