104
00:08:56,850 --> 00:08:58,030
Good for you, that's admirable

105
00:08:58,030 --> 00:09:01,990
So if you play too much Splatoon now, it'll keep deforming?

106
00:09:01,990 --> 00:09:04,490
There's a possibility of that, so be careful

107
00:09:04,490 --> 00:09:06,110
I see

108
00:09:06,110 --> 00:09:08,030
Got it

109
00:09:08,030 --> 00:09:10,210
All that spinning around for so long...

110
00:09:10,210 --> 00:09:12,810
