111
00:09:12,810 --> 00:09:15,570
Sorry for scaring you

112
00:09:15,570 --> 00:09:17,410
The cartilage...

113
00:09:17,410 --> 00:09:21,370
But I was really playing an insane amount

114
00:09:21,370 --> 00:09:28,330
Yeah, that makes sense... Mackerel? Hmm, mackerel... should I use a Squiffer too?

115
00:09:28,330 --> 00:09:33,850
Oh, long range is that one, kind of... yeah that one

116
00:09:33,850 --> 00:09:38,890
Since we're a full party today, we want someone to ink, right?

117
00:09:38,890 --> 00:09:43,510
I'll take the Squid Beakon! Yay, the rice planting one!

118
00:09:43,510 --> 00:09:46,780
I'll do the rice planting! I like it because it inks fast

119
00:09:46,780 --> 00:09:48,970
I'll ink while testing it out

120
00:09:48,970 --> 00:09:50,970
Yay, I'm so happy!

121
00:09:50,970 --> 00:09:53,310
Now we can rack up kills!

122
00:09:53,310 --> 00:09:54,470
