134
00:10:18,210 --> 00:10:21,010
A Charger, right? A Charger

135
00:10:21,010 --> 00:10:23,010
What are you talking about?

136
00:10:23,010 --> 00:10:27,010
I think using your favorite weapon is totally fine

137
00:10:27,010 --> 00:10:29,010
Let's go with our favorite weapons for now

138
00:10:29,010 --> 00:10:31,010
