139
00:10:31,010 --> 00:10:33,010
Your absolute favorite

140
00:10:33,010 --> 00:10:34,810
Go with your absolute favorite, it's fine

141
00:10:34,810 --> 00:10:36,810
Go left, go upper left

142
00:10:38,810 --> 00:10:40,810
It's traumatizing, it's become a trauma

143
00:10:40,810 --> 00:10:43,610
