144
00:10:43,610 --> 00:10:46,710
But maybe I'll try the one I just bought, this one

145
00:10:46,710 --> 00:10:48,310
Oh nice, nice

146
00:10:48,310 --> 00:10:49,310
Is this a Blaster?

147
00:10:49,310 --> 00:10:50,270
That's the hard one

148
00:10:50,270 --> 00:10:52,110
