153
00:11:02,410 --> 00:11:06,910
And when you're properly balanced on the ground, it gets a bit longer

154
00:11:06,910 --> 00:11:12,010
But in terms of range, it's like, a bit shorter than the Hot Blaster?

155
00:11:12,010 --> 00:11:16,010
But when you're not jumping, isn't it a bit longer?

156
00:11:16,010 --> 00:11:17,810
It's shorter than the Luffy

157
00:11:17,810 --> 00:11:21,810
Yeah, but if you can use it well, it's really strong

158
00:11:21,810 --> 00:11:23,810
