159
00:11:23,810 --> 00:11:26,810
But I feel like I got wrecked by this one earlier

160
00:11:26,810 --> 00:11:29,610
Skilled players are really skilled

161
00:11:29,610 --> 00:11:31,610
Oh no, everyone was already ready!

162
00:11:31,610 --> 00:11:33,610
Oh, no worries, no worries!

163
00:11:33,610 --> 00:11:34,610
It's fine, take your time, take your time.

164
00:11:34,610 --> 00:11:35,610
Maybe I'll try using it once.

165
00:11:35,610 --> 00:11:37,610
I'm kind of a Blaster main, so that's my thing.

166
00:11:37,610 --> 00:11:38,610
Right, right.

167
00:11:38,610 --> 00:11:39,470
Nice!

168
00:11:39,470 --> 00:11:49,170
Whoa, we're actually having a real weapon conversation! We're talking about weapons, amazing!

169
00:11:49,170 --> 00:11:56,510
I'm genuinely moved right now — like, I don't even know what to say, it's like "whatever" usually.

170
00:11:56,510 --> 00:12:01,370
I like unusual patterns — like, keep it, I love it!

171
00:12:02,270 --> 00:12:08,350
We're having an actual weapon conversation and I'm moved. I'm seriously moved!

172
00:12:08,350 --> 00:12:16,830
Nice to meet you! Please take care of us! Alright, let's go, sensei! Oh, Miyo-chan tends to report things pretty often, you know.

173
00:12:16,830 --> 00:12:23,360
Oh, I'll be careful! Yeah, she reports a lot.

174
00:12:23,360 --> 00:12:25,250
Look out! Crab Tank incoming! Watch out!

175
00:12:26,370 --> 00:12:26,870
Oh—

176
00:12:26,570 --> 00:12:28,570
Oh no, oh no, oh no, oh no!

177
00:12:28,570 --> 00:12:29,570
Oh no, oh no, oh no!

178
00:12:29,570 --> 00:12:30,570
Oh no, oh no, oh no!

179
00:12:30,570 --> 00:12:31,370
I'm calling the shark! Calling the shark!

180
00:12:31,370 --> 00:12:32,370
Oh no, oh no, oh no!

181
00:12:32,370 --> 00:12:33,370
Back, back, back, back, back!

182
00:12:33,370 --> 00:12:35,010
Let me just leave it here for now.

183
00:12:35,010 --> 00:12:37,770
Oh, but it left! It left! The Shark Ride left!

184
00:12:37,770 --> 00:12:38,570
