187
00:12:42,170 --> 00:12:47,770
Oh no! Oh no! Oh no! My aim is off!

188
00:12:47,770 --> 00:12:51,930
Why won't you talk?!

189
00:12:51,930 --> 00:12:53,930
This is so clean though!

190
00:12:53,930 --> 00:12:55,730
This guy just keeps wandering around.

191
00:12:55,730 --> 00:12:56,730
Just wandering around.

192
00:12:56,730 --> 00:12:58,730
They keep wandering around over here.

193
00:12:58,730 --> 00:12:59,730
Like a bug, like a bug!

194
00:12:59,730 --> 00:13:01,530
They're really pushing in though.

195
00:13:01,530 --> 00:13:02,530
Really pushing in.

196
00:13:02,530 --> 00:13:04,330
So aggressive.

197
00:13:04,330 --> 00:13:08,130
Ah, Kouji and the others want to push in over there too.

198
00:13:08,130 --> 00:13:09,930
Wanna push in, wanna push in!

199
00:13:09,930 --> 00:13:13,730
Why?! Why is it a trade?! Nice trade?!

200
00:13:14,530 --> 00:13:16,530
Oh no oh no oh no oh no oh no! My aim!

201
00:13:17,330 --> 00:13:21,330
Yeah, it's tough, right? The E-liter is really hard.

202
00:13:21,330 --> 00:13:24,110
I'll just focus on inking for now, just gonna ink.

203
00:13:27,410 --> 00:13:29,330
They're targeting me right now!

204
00:13:30,130 --> 00:13:32,130
Oh, there's someone in front of the platform.

205
00:13:32,130 --> 00:13:34,130
Nice, nice, nice!

206
00:13:34,930 --> 00:13:36,830
Someone's there.

207
00:13:36,830 --> 00:13:38,730
I'll just ink here.

208
00:13:38,730 --> 00:13:40,530
Oh right, there's the fireworks at the end.

209
00:13:40,530 --> 00:13:42,530
I always forget the fireworks.

210
00:13:42,530 --> 00:13:44,530
Don't forget the fireworks, everyone!

211
00:13:44,530 --> 00:13:46,530
It's pretty important.

212
00:13:46,530 --> 00:13:48,530
Shark Ride!

213
00:13:48,530 --> 00:13:50,530
Nice, nice!

214
00:13:50,530 --> 00:13:52,330
Totan got them!

215
00:13:52,330 --> 00:13:54,130
They're taking them out!

216
00:13:54,130 --> 00:13:55,930
I'll do it too.

217
00:13:55,930 --> 00:13:57,730
This is bad.

218
00:13:57,730 --> 00:13:59,730
