222
00:14:08,480 --> 00:14:10,930
No, but from here, from here, from here, it starts here!

223
00:14:10,930 --> 00:14:12,430
Got one, got one!

224
00:14:12,430 --> 00:14:13,430
Nice, nice!

225
00:14:15,230 --> 00:14:16,730
We'll push from here, from here!

226
00:14:16,730 --> 00:14:17,730
Oh, Ayuchi!

227
00:14:17,730 --> 00:14:18,730
Oh, nice, Ayuchi!

228
00:14:18,730 --> 00:14:19,730
Nice, Ayuchi!

229
00:14:20,530 --> 00:14:22,530
We can't get the middle at all.

230
00:14:23,330 --> 00:14:24,330
From here, from here!

231
00:14:25,130 --> 00:14:26,130
There's still a minute left.

232
00:14:26,130 --> 00:14:27,130
Yeah.

233
00:14:27,130 --> 00:14:28,930
With a minute left, we can ink it back!

234
00:14:29,230 --> 00:14:31,230
Oh no, you're gonna get me again!

235
00:14:33,030 --> 00:14:34,730
That guy's pushing in again!

236
00:14:34,730 --> 00:14:38,330
I'll just ignore them — everyone else handle it, I'll deal with the others.

237
00:14:46,030 --> 00:14:47,630
Oh no oh no oh no oh no!

238
00:14:47,630 --> 00:14:50,430
Ahaha, watch out when they get close!

239
00:14:50,430 --> 00:14:51,920
Yeah, gotta watch out for that.

240
00:14:55,330 --> 00:14:57,630
The shark is crazy, the shark is crazy!

241
00:15:00,690 --> 00:15:03,020
Sorry, Bolognese, you can't go there!

242
00:15:06,820 --> 00:15:08,820
I just can't do it!

243
00:15:13,220 --> 00:15:15,220
That's rough!

244
00:15:15,220 --> 00:15:17,220
Isn't this hard? Isn't it?

245
00:15:17,220 --> 00:15:19,220
Yeah, that thing is tough.

246
00:15:19,220 --> 00:15:21,220
It really is hard, like I thought.

247
00:15:21,220 --> 00:15:23,180
Once they get close, it's over.

248
00:15:24,020 --> 00:15:29,020
I'm still not used to it, so I think the Hot Blaster is more reliable.

249
00:15:29,020 --> 00:15:32,460
Maybe start with the Hot Blaster and switch to the S-Blaster once you're used to it.

250
00:15:32,460 --> 00:15:33,820
That makes sense.

251
00:15:33,820 --> 00:15:35,340
It's a range issue.

252
00:15:35,340 --> 00:15:38,020
I can't use the S-Blaster either.

253
00:15:38,020 --> 00:15:40,700
It's hard, but it's hard.

254
00:15:40,700 --> 00:15:42,540
Blasters in general are just hard.

255
00:15:42,540 --> 00:15:43,820
I'll try out different things.

256
00:15:43,820 --> 00:15:44,780
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

257
00:15:44,780 --> 00:15:46,860
Like just now too—

258
00:15:46,860 --> 00:15:49,180
I'll switch things up too.

259
00:15:49,180 --> 00:15:51,540
It's nice that everyone has a weapon they can swap to.

260
00:15:53,020 --> 00:15:53,740
It's fine!

261
00:15:53,740 --> 00:15:55,180
Caplio, you can just stay as you are!

262
00:15:56,780 --> 00:15:58,780
