01:32:16,920 --> 01:32:20,700
In three more minutes I'll be free

2159
01:32:20,700 --> 01:32:21,940
I'm curious

2160
01:32:21,940 --> 01:32:24,620
Just a little more progress

2161
01:32:24,620 --> 01:32:26,920
What should I use next?

2162
01:32:26,920 --> 01:32:31,060
Mio-sha looks like she's having a blast

2163
01:32:31,060 --> 01:32:33,400
Mio-sha, what about charge-type weapons?

2164
01:32:33,400 --> 01:32:34,240
How are you with those?

2165
01:32:34,240 --> 01:32:37,400
I'm not great with charge-type weapons

2166
01:32:37,960 --> 01:32:38,840
I see

2167
01:32:38,840 --> 01:32:43,880
I mainly used Blaster-types before

2168
01:32:43,880 --> 01:32:46,480
Sorry everyone, this is the only standing art I have for Mino-chan

2169
01:32:46,480 --> 01:32:47,140
Like a bath or something?

2170
01:32:47,140 --> 01:32:50,420
A bath sounds nice

2171
01:32:50,420 --> 01:32:53,620
Have you ever used the Hissen or anything like that?

2172
01:32:53,620 --> 01:32:55,180
Not really, I don't think

2173
01:32:55,180 --> 01:32:56,760
I'm not great with Roller-types either

2174
01:32:56,760 --> 01:32:58,600
The Hissen can get you so many kills though

2175
01:32:58,600 --> 01:32:59,400
Really?

2176
01:32:59,400 --> 01:33:01,380
Getting kills with the Hissen feels so good

2177
01:33:01,380 --> 01:33:02,700
I might lose my mind

2178
01:33:02,700 --> 01:33:04,440
Yeah, you really might lose your mind

2179
01:33:04,440 --> 01:33:07,420
Your energy just goes off the rails

2180
01:33:07,420 --> 01:33:13,720
If Korone picks up the Hissen or a brush-type, she'll probably go feral

2181
01:33:13,720 --> 01:33:15,720
I wanna see it, show me, show me!

2182
01:33:15,720 --> 01:33:17,720
I wanna see the Hissen

2183
01:33:17,720 --> 01:33:19,540
That's what I wanna see, that's what I wanna see!

2184
01:33:19,540 --> 01:33:21,520
I'd actually go as far as to say that's what I want to see most

2185
01:33:21,520 --> 01:33:23,520
I'd probably get really loud though

2186
01:33:23,520 --> 01:33:25,520
I wanna see it, I wanna see it!

2187
01:33:25,520 --> 01:33:27,520
Show me once, and then we'll judge from there

2188
01:33:29,320 --> 01:33:31,320
The Hissen — is that the bucket one?

2189
01:33:31,320 --> 01:33:33,120
Yeah, the bucket, the blue bucket

2190
01:33:33,120 --> 01:33:36,540
The Mochi blue variant is recommended

2191
01:33:36,540 --> 01:33:41,140
There was a period where the Hissen was insanely strong in Splatoon 3

2192
01:33:41,140 --> 01:33:42,320
It's still strong now

2193
01:33:42,320 --> 01:33:49,540
I really used it a lot back then, but the range just isn't enough

2194
01:33:49,540 --> 01:33:51,480
It's a little frustrating

2195
01:33:51,480 --> 01:33:54,880
Moppurin?

2196
01:33:54,880 --> 01:33:55,400
Huh? What?

2197
01:33:55,600 --> 01:33:56,520
Moppurin?

2198
01:33:59,100 --> 01:34:00,120
Like the Moppurin?

2199
01:34:00,120 --> 01:34:01,680
Moppurin? What's that?

2200
01:34:01,680 --> 01:34:06,700
Moppurin is hard though. If anything, you're better off with the Hissen

2201
01:34:06,700 --> 01:34:10,960
It's not that strong in ranked. It's fine for Salmon Run though

2202
01:34:10,960 --> 01:34:15,880
In regular battles, Moppurin would be a struggle, I think

2203
01:34:15,880 --> 01:34:17,240
What even is Moppurin?

2204
01:34:17,240 --> 01:34:19,440
It's a cute name, right? Moppurin — it's the mop-looking one

2205
01:34:19,440 --> 01:34:22,820
It sounds like Mocchorin

2206
01:34:22,820 --> 01:34:24,220
I want some rice crackers

2207
01:34:24,220 --> 01:34:25,060
Hm?

2208
01:34:25,060 --> 01:34:26,760
What about the Grim Range Blaster?

2209
01:34:26,760 --> 01:34:28,240
Oh wait, does that count as a charge-type?

2210
01:34:28,240 --> 01:34:31,080
Yeah, I haven't really used it much

2211
01:34:31,080 --> 01:34:34,040
It's a weapon that came with Splatoon 3

2212
01:34:34,040 --> 01:34:38,240
It's actually a pretty strong weapon

2213
01:34:38,240 --> 01:34:40,900
I get the impression it has high kill potential

2214
01:34:40,900 --> 01:34:43,300
Yeah, that's right

2215
01:34:43,300 --> 01:34:46,040
It shoots pretty far too

2216
01:34:46,040 --> 01:34:48,000
What about the L-3 Nozzlenose?

2217
01:34:48,000 --> 01:34:50,680
The Nozzlenose is tough

2218
01:34:50,680 --> 01:34:53,080
The L is stronger than the H

2219
01:34:53,080 --> 01:34:54,440
The H is weak

2220
01:34:54,440 --> 01:34:56,800
The 3-shot burst is what makes it strong

2221
01:34:56,800 --> 01:34:59,540
No no, the 3-shot burst is what makes it hard to use

2222
01:35:00,200 --> 01:35:01,440
Well, I mean...

2223
01:35:01,440 --> 01:35:03,260
Good players can make it work, but yeah

2224
01:35:03,260 --> 01:35:04,940
Ta-ta-tan, ta-ta-tan

2225
01:35:04,940 --> 01:35:07,200
It's technically a shooter, the Nozzlenose

2226
01:35:07,200 --> 01:35:08,380
Sure, sure

2227
01:35:09,700 --> 01:35:12,180
The Nozzlenose is weirdly hard to use

2228
01:35:12,680 --> 01:35:13,440
Hmm

2229
01:35:13,440 --> 01:35:15,240
Which one is stronger again, the H?

2230
01:35:15,640 --> 01:35:17,080
No, the H is weak

2231
01:35:17,240 --> 01:35:18,140
The H is weak

2232
01:35:18,140 --> 01:35:19,640
The L is strong

2233
01:35:19,640 --> 01:35:20,140
The L is strong

2234
01:35:20,140 --> 01:35:21,540
But I personally like the H better

2235
01:35:21,540 --> 01:35:23,400
It's the H-3 Nozzlenose, IRyS!

2236
01:35:23,400 --> 01:35:24,200
Stop it

2237
01:35:24,200 --> 01:35:28,740
You were saying it normally at first!

2238
01:35:28,740 --> 01:35:30,220
IRyS and her H...

2239
01:35:30,220 --> 01:35:31,700
Stop it!

2240
01:35:31,700 --> 01:35:32,960
That was on purpose

2241
01:35:32,960 --> 01:35:35,680
It's definitely on purpose — whenever she says something naughty

2242
01:35:35,680 --> 01:35:37,870
it always ends up like this

2243
01:35:37,870 --> 01:35:39,020
it's always like this, huh

2244
01:35:39,020 --> 01:35:41,760
So you're saying IRyS is asking for the naughty stuff?

2245
01:35:42,000 --> 01:35:43,060
I'm not asking for anything!

2246
01:35:43,060 --> 01:35:46,480
Flare's asking for it too

2247
01:35:46,480 --> 01:35:47,980
Because Flare starts the naughty talk

2248
01:35:47,980 --> 01:35:49,120
Even IRyS suddenly starts

2249
01:35:49,120 --> 01:35:50,800
bringing up naughty topics

2250
01:35:50,800 --> 01:36:00,800
I've never started it! I've never seen that! Last time or so, I asked "Is this a naughty topic?"

2251
01:36:03,350 --> 01:36:10,350
But it's probably childish naughty stuff anyway, right? Childish naughty. Childish naughty is wild.

2252
01:36:10,350 --> 01:36:14,350
Where's the line for childish naughty, though? I don't know.

2253
01:36:14,350 --> 01:36:19,010
I want to hear it first before judging, so can you say it again?

2254
01:36:19,010 --> 01:36:21,410
No no, I don't even know what we're talking about anymore

2255
01:36:21,410 --> 01:36:23,490
Please stop

2256
01:36:23,490 --> 01:36:26,870
Please stop bullying your junior

2257
01:36:26,870 --> 01:36:29,330
No no no

2258
01:36:29,330 --> 01:36:30,830
We're gonna get reported

2259
01:36:30,830 --> 01:36:34,190
Were you using a different weapon? Like the Examiner?

2260
01:36:34,190 --> 01:36:35,990
The Examiner?

2261
01:36:36,140 --> 01:36:38,070
Which one is the Examiner again? Is it the ballpoint pen?

2262
01:36:38,070 --> 01:36:40,390
The one with a long charge that covers a lot of ground

2263
01:36:40,390 --> 01:36:42,550
The ballpoint pen, right

2264
01:36:42,550 --> 01:36:44,550
Wait, wasn't that the ballpoint pen?

2265
01:36:44,550 --> 01:36:46,350
The ballpoint pen would be the Kugel, I think

2266
01:36:46,350 --> 01:36:47,350
Oh right

2267
01:36:47,350 --> 01:36:51,150
The Vitamina is the marker one with three tips

2268
01:36:51,150 --> 01:36:53,150
The one that covers a lot of ground

2269
01:36:53,150 --> 01:36:54,950
Yeah it covers a lot

2270
01:36:54,950 --> 01:36:57,950
It's kind of ballpoint-pen-like too though

2271
01:36:57,950 --> 01:36:59,950
Like three ballpoint pens stuck together

2272
01:36:59,950 --> 01:37:02,750
Oh yeah yeah, like a highlighter marker kind of thing

2273
01:37:02,750 --> 01:37:04,550
Yeah yeah

2274
01:37:04,550 --> 01:37:07,350
That one's actually pretty strong too

2275
01:37:07,350 --> 01:37:09,350
By the way, I made it back to my room

2276
01:37:09,350 --> 01:37:15,950
Waiting on Mio-sha. IRyS is back. I'm a free woman now.

2277
01:37:15,950 --> 01:37:21,750
So what's everyone doing? The punishment for going to the bathroom?

2278
01:37:21,750 --> 01:37:27,680
The punishment for going to the toilet — that's a heavy penalty, super heavy

2279
01:37:27,680 --> 01:37:33,350
I switched to a regular roller with the barrier special. The standard one.

2280
01:37:33,350 --> 01:37:37,150
And you changed the sub to Gym on that weapon too?

2281
01:37:37,150 --> 01:37:39,950
I thought it looked cool

2282
01:37:39,950 --> 01:37:45,750
But yeah, the default sub being Shock Wander makes it tricky

2283
01:37:45,750 --> 01:37:46,750
Right, right, exactly

2284
01:37:46,750 --> 01:37:47,740
That could work, that could work

2285
01:37:47,740 --> 01:37:51,550
So I figured the Trizooka would be easier to fire as a special

2286
01:37:51,550 --> 01:37:53,350
Is that the sub weapon?

2287
01:37:53,350 --> 01:37:57,250
The sub is the Robo Bomb

2288
01:37:57,250 --> 01:37:59,950
That's totally fine

2289
01:37:59,950 --> 01:38:03,280
Oh, sounds strong

2290
01:38:03,700 --> 01:38:10,440
If you charge it up more, you can get like two shots to get a kill, kind of like the Bamboozler

2291
01:38:10,440 --> 01:38:15,580
At its strongest, if your aim is on point, you can deal 140. Ooh.

2292
01:38:15,580 --> 01:38:21,420
If you put in forward input, won't your aim go off?

2293
01:38:21,420 --> 01:38:24,900
I mean, I don't think the enemy is just gonna wait around for you

2294
01:38:24,900 --> 01:38:31,770
I imagine you'd charge while jumping around, but is that not how it works?

2295
01:38:31,990 --> 01:38:37,210
Hmm, I wonder. Can you pull it off?

2296
01:38:37,750 --> 01:38:41,610
Seems tough. But I'll give it a try once.

2297
01:38:41,610 --> 01:38:46,550
If you can master the Wiper, you'd be unstoppable

2298
01:38:46,550 --> 01:38:49,670
I see, but the feel of it is close to the brush

2299
01:38:49,670 --> 01:38:54,670
Like a brush that shoots a bit farther

2300
01:38:54,670 --> 01:38:59,270
For brushes though, the Inkbrush Nouveau feels great first

2301
01:38:59,270 --> 01:39:03,070
As long as you don't mind heavier weapons

2302
01:39:03,070 --> 01:39:05,070
I see

2303
01:39:05,070 --> 01:39:07,870
Hokusai and Inkbrush Nouveau

2304
01:39:07,870 --> 01:39:11,670
It's more of a slash-slash feel, so it's a bit heavy

2305
01:39:11,670 --> 01:39:13,670
A bit lighter than the Hokusai

2306
01:39:13,670 --> 01:39:16,670
The brush is the heaviest

2307
01:39:16,670 --> 01:39:19,670
But you can take someone out in two hits

2308
01:39:19,670 --> 01:39:21,470
Do your best — you've gotta land those hits

2309
01:39:21,470 --> 01:39:23,170
Let's go!

2310
01:39:23,170 --> 01:39:24,070
Gotta go for kills

2311
01:39:24,070 --> 01:39:25,870
It's probably a kill weapon

2312
01:39:25,870 --> 01:39:28,670
Yeah, it's definitely a kill weapon

2313
01:39:28,670 --> 01:39:29,670
Go go go!

2314
01:39:32,440 --> 01:39:36,440
The Lacto is strongest when you're really good with it, but

2315
01:39:36,440 --> 01:39:38,240
It's really not going well

2316
01:39:39,180 --> 01:39:41,530
Oh no oh no oh no

2317
01:39:41,530 --> 01:39:42,530
Sorry, I got taken out

2318
01:39:42,530 --> 01:39:44,530
What was that — a Rapid Blaster? Yeah, Rapid Blaster

2319
01:39:44,530 --> 01:39:45,330
Ugh

2320
01:39:45,330 --> 01:39:47,330
I got splatted

2321
01:39:49,130 --> 01:39:52,130
Rapid Blaster's range management is tough

2322
01:39:53,930 --> 01:39:56,930
and the Eliter is just incomprehensible

2323
01:39:58,740 --> 01:40:02,540
"No no, help me!" — what is this guy doing?

2324
01:40:03,340 --> 01:40:05,140
Who is this? I don't even know

2325
01:40:06,140 --> 01:40:08,940
This guy is insane, insane, insane!

2326
01:40:08,940 --> 01:40:10,740
Wait, wait — this is impossible!

2327
01:40:10,740 --> 01:40:13,740
Wait, impossible! The Rapid's special is insane! My own special might not cut it!

2328
01:40:14,540 --> 01:40:17,340
Clash Blaster is gone. This is bad.

2329
01:40:17,340 --> 01:40:20,140
Yeah, the Clash Blaster just has bad matchups here, it's not good.

2330
01:40:20,940 --> 01:40:22,880
Wait, I got taken out by a Rapid Blaster?

2331
01:40:23,740 --> 01:40:28,340
You, you — impossible! My special is useless! I can't aim at all!

2332
01:40:29,340 --> 01:40:34,340
I'm just dead weight. This is rough. A new weapon is seriously hard, isn't it?

2333
01:40:34,340 --> 01:40:37,340
This might be impossible. I hate Blasters!

2334
01:40:38,140 --> 01:40:40,140
This might be impossible...

2335
01:40:40,940 --> 01:40:42,940
Oh no, I'm gonna be dead weight!

2336
01:40:42,940 --> 01:40:44,740
I hate this!

2337
01:40:45,540 --> 01:40:47,540
It's my first time trying it out, so...

2338
01:40:47,540 --> 01:40:50,340
This is bad! This is bad! This is bad!

2339
01:40:51,250 --> 01:40:54,250
Getting taken out left and right, yeah

2340
01:40:54,250 --> 01:40:56,850
Getting wrecked pretty hard out there

2341
01:40:56,850 --> 01:40:57,850
This is seriously bad!

2342
01:40:57,850 --> 01:41:00,850
There are Blasters everywhere I go!

2343
01:41:01,650 --> 01:41:04,650
But thanks to you going wild over there,

2344
01:41:04,650 --> 01:41:06,450
I managed to take one out

2345
01:41:06,450 --> 01:41:07,250
Nice!

2346
01:41:07,250 --> 01:41:09,050
This might be a bit rough

2347
01:41:09,050 --> 01:41:13,450
I'm dragging the team down pretty hard right now

2348
01:41:13,450 --> 01:41:16,450
Well it's your first time, so that's expected

2349
01:41:16,450 --> 01:41:17,250
Yeah, exactly

2350
01:41:17,250 --> 01:41:18,250
Clash Blaster is actually...

2351
01:41:18,250 --> 01:41:20,050
once you mess around with it a bit...

2352
01:41:20,050 --> 01:41:22,050
the Clash Blaster is wild

2353
01:41:23,850 --> 01:41:26,850
Ugh, I hate it, someone help me

2354
01:41:26,850 --> 01:41:30,370
That was rough — I'm dying here, this is insane

2355
01:41:30,370 --> 01:41:33,370
This weapon loadout is probably the worst for Korone

2356
01:41:35,330 --> 01:41:37,170
Korone's probably got it the hardest right now

2357
01:41:37,170 --> 01:41:38,930
It's really rough though

2358
01:41:38,930 --> 01:41:39,770
This might be really bad

2359
01:41:39,770 --> 01:41:40,770
This is seriously rough

2360
01:41:40,770 --> 01:41:42,770
Oh, I took out 2 people! Two of them!

2361
01:41:42,770 --> 01:41:43,770
Whoa, nice!

2362
01:41:43,770 --> 01:41:44,770
No no no

2363
01:41:48,920 --> 01:41:50,920
For now let me just ink with the Curling Bomb

2364
01:41:50,920 --> 01:41:51,920
I hate Blasters

2365
01:41:51,920 --> 01:41:53,920
Yes! I got a kill!

2366
01:41:53,920 --> 01:41:54,920
Nice, nice!

2367
01:41:54,920 --> 01:41:56,920
IRyS, isn't that your destiny weapon?

2368
01:41:56,920 --> 01:41:58,720
Wait, no way

2369
01:41:59,720 --> 01:42:02,520
Nice! That was great!

2370
01:42:02,520 --> 01:42:04,320
Nooo! I got taken out! This is bad! Clash Blaster is insane!

2371
01:42:04,320 --> 01:42:07,320
We're falling behind over here! This is bad bad bad! Hold on!

2372
01:42:07,320 --> 01:42:09,120
Oh wow, really

2373
01:42:12,940 --> 01:42:16,940
Ugh, what is this?! I'm not throwing balloons anymore! Nooo!

2374
01:42:19,740 --> 01:42:22,740
What even is this?! What is going on?!

2375
01:42:25,330 --> 01:42:27,220
This is rough

2376
01:42:27,220 --> 01:42:28,130
And there's the aftermath of that flyer

2377
01:42:28,130 --> 01:42:31,130
That was completely my fault, I dragged everyone down

2378
01:42:31,130 --> 01:42:32,990
No no, that's not true

2379
01:42:32,990 --> 01:42:34,190
IRyS was fighting hard

2380
01:42:34,190 --> 01:42:37,510
But the fact that you got 1 kill means it could become your destiny weapon

2381
01:42:37,510 --> 01:42:38,630
And it was your first time too

2382
01:42:40,690 --> 01:42:42,570
First time and everything

2383
01:42:42,570 --> 01:42:44,230
Well, you won't know until you try it

2384
01:42:45,730 --> 01:42:48,390
It was tough — I couldn't ink much at all

2385
01:42:49,450 --> 01:42:51,950
You can't ink with it? Oh right, it's more of a slashing weapon

2386
01:42:52,310 --> 01:42:53,690
More or less, yeah

2387
01:42:53,690 --> 01:42:57,630
Ink management is hard too, it runs out so fast — yeah, exactly, it runs out so fast

2388
01:42:57,630 --> 01:42:59,870
And the aiming is hard — I'm still customizing it

2389
01:42:59,870 --> 01:43:01,870
How's the Painbrush working out?

2390
01:43:01,670 --> 01:43:05,670
Hmmmmmm

2391
01:43:05,670 --> 01:43:11,670
But if the brush I'm thinking of is like the Inkbrush Nouveau, it might be different from what I'm imagining

2392
01:43:11,670 --> 01:43:14,670
I see — but there's a chance it could feel good too

2393
01:43:14,670 --> 01:43:18,670
And if that works out, maybe I can handle heavier weapons

2394
01:43:18,670 --> 01:43:20,670
Really? That'd be great

2395
01:43:20,670 --> 01:43:22,670
Like maybe even the Dynamo Roller

2396
01:43:22,670 --> 01:43:24,670
That'd be awesome!

2397
01:43:24,670 --> 01:43:26,670
Just splashing down from above and people die

2398
01:43:26,670 --> 01:43:28,670
Oh nice!

2399
01:43:28,470 --> 01:43:35,070
I see — it's like a lighter swing than the Dynamo

2400
01:43:35,070 --> 01:43:39,070
Just jump and do two quick swings — if it hits, they're dead

2401
01:43:39,070 --> 01:43:41,070
Ugh, that sounds awful.

2402
01:43:41,070 --> 01:43:44,870
There's a bit of a windup when you swing it.

2403
01:43:44,870 --> 01:43:47,780
But that weight actually gives it a nice feel.

2404
01:43:47,780 --> 01:43:51,670
It uses a lot of ink, so it's good to run around a bit after.

2405
01:43:51,670 --> 01:43:53,670
After you do the splat-splat.

2406
01:43:55,270 --> 01:43:57,270
Yeah, the ink recovery is really slow.

2407
01:43:57,270 --> 01:43:58,940
Okaaay.

2408
01:43:58,940 --> 01:44:00,870
Splish splash!

2409
01:44:00,870 --> 01:44:04,770
If you put something like main ink saver on your gear,

2410
01:44:04,770 --> 01:44:06,670
