03:23:19,250 --> 03:23:22,290
We can't push back at all.

4806
03:23:22,290 --> 03:23:24,350
No no no, I don't want this, I don't want this!

4807
03:23:24,350 --> 03:23:25,770
I wanted to go down there!

4808
03:23:25,770 --> 03:23:28,110
Ugh!

4809
03:23:28,110 --> 03:23:29,570
I want to go that way!

4810
03:23:29,570 --> 03:23:31,490
Can I super jump over there?

4811
03:23:31,490 --> 03:23:32,930
Jumping!

4812
03:23:32,930 --> 03:23:35,330
Everyone's over there!

4813
03:23:35,330 --> 03:23:35,730
This might be bad!

4814
03:23:35,730 --> 03:23:39,630
This is bad, this is really bad!

4815
03:23:39,630 --> 03:23:42,810
Seriously, their ink coverage is insane.

4816
03:23:43,370 --> 03:23:45,170
The ink coverage is so strong, right?

4817
03:23:45,170 --> 03:23:47,170
They're pushing into our base!

4818
03:23:47,170 --> 03:23:49,170
No! Zipcaster!

4819
03:23:49,170 --> 03:23:51,170
This is bad~

4820
03:23:51,170 --> 03:23:53,020
I got splatted~

4821
03:23:53,020 --> 03:23:54,970
I keep getting splatted~

4822
03:23:54,970 --> 03:23:56,970
Here they come~ This side's dead too~

4823
03:23:56,970 --> 03:23:58,770
Uwah~

4824
03:23:58,770 --> 03:24:00,570
They re-ink it so fast!

4825
03:24:00,570 --> 03:24:02,570
It's a tough one~

4826
03:24:02,570 --> 03:24:04,370
Ugh~

4827
03:24:04,370 --> 03:24:06,370
This is bad!

4828
03:24:06,370 --> 03:24:08,370
They really pushed in on us~

4829
03:24:08,370 --> 03:24:11,970
Isn't the Shark Ride's range way too strong?

4830
03:24:11,970 --> 03:24:14,960
It's really strong, yeah.

4831
03:24:14,960 --> 03:24:19,770
Did it get buffed because people kept saying it was weak?

4832
03:24:19,770 --> 03:24:21,570
It got buffed alright!

4833
03:24:21,570 --> 03:24:23,490
Out of pity!

4834
03:24:26,170 --> 03:24:28,970
Well, the ink coverage is just insane though.

4835
03:24:28,970 --> 03:24:30,970
But it's fun that we can all do it together!

4836
03:24:32,770 --> 03:24:37,690
Come on, come on! Playing together is what matters!

4837
03:24:37,690 --> 03:24:43,410
Well, if we had longer-range weapons, we would've steamrolled them.

4838
03:24:43,410 --> 03:24:45,270
We won 100 times over anyway!

4839
03:24:45,270 --> 03:24:48,290
I'll switch to Dynamo, let me try Dynamo.

4840
03:24:48,290 --> 03:24:48,830
Nice!

4841
03:24:48,830 --> 03:24:49,850
Dynamo!

4842
03:24:49,850 --> 03:24:51,510
Going for coverage, coverage!

4843
03:24:51,510 --> 03:24:55,110
Oh, then I'll go with Kensa Mini Splatling!

4844
03:24:55,110 --> 03:24:57,610
Inspiration!

4845
03:24:57,610 --> 03:25:00,730
I'll just stick with what I have then.

4846
03:25:00,730 --> 03:25:02,590
Let's go with this!

4847
03:25:02,590 --> 03:25:03,470
No way, no way!

4848
03:25:03,470 --> 03:25:06,290
Let's protect the Dynamo user!

4849
03:25:06,290 --> 03:25:08,970
Dynamo is amazing! Dynamo!

4850
03:25:08,970 --> 03:25:11,690
The impact is just on another level!

4851
03:25:11,690 --> 03:25:13,830
But the swing is slow,

4852
03:25:13,830 --> 03:25:16,930
so when you fight a regular Splat Roller,

4853
03:25:16,930 --> 03:25:19,590
if you miss, you die instantly.

4854
03:25:19,590 --> 03:25:21,890
Yeah...

4855
03:25:21,890 --> 03:25:24,270
Like, while Korone swings twice, you only get one swing.

4856
03:25:24,270 --> 03:25:27,870
Yeah, that's true.

4857
03:25:27,870 --> 03:25:29,710
You really need to focus. Concentration is key.

4858
03:25:32,410 --> 03:25:34,870
There's a Charger! This is bad!

4859
03:25:34,870 --> 03:25:35,870
And it's on this side too!

4860
03:25:36,830 --> 03:25:38,510
We have to protect the Dynamo!

4861
03:25:38,510 --> 03:25:39,140
I'll protect them!

4862
03:25:39,140 --> 03:25:41,070
I came to protect and now they're over here!

4863
03:25:42,730 --> 03:25:43,410
I'll protect!

4864
03:25:43,410 --> 03:25:45,830
But I switched to Tenta Missiles now,

4865
03:25:45,830 --> 03:25:47,930
so I can't really ink much.

4866
03:25:48,610 --> 03:25:49,330
Seriously?

4867
03:25:50,130 --> 03:25:52,470
Blaster incoming! Blaster incoming!

4868
03:25:52,470 --> 03:25:54,610
Blasters are a bad matchup for us.

4869
03:25:54,610 --> 03:25:55,570
Yeah, you're right.

4870
03:25:56,670 --> 03:26:01,120
I'll just quietly ink our own turf.

4871
03:26:01,280 --> 03:26:06,660
Wow, that Blaster is good! They're really good! That Blaster might be skilled.

4872
03:26:06,660 --> 03:26:12,380
They're using Blaster! That Nova player is good!

4873
03:26:12,660 --> 03:26:15,070
Whoa.

4874
03:26:15,270 --> 03:26:17,910
Whoa~ I'll just ink our base!

4875
03:26:17,910 --> 03:26:20,290
Okay~

4876
03:26:20,690 --> 03:26:30,110
This is bad, no matter where I go or what I do, I'm always being watched! Something's off — I can't get to the front at all, this is weird!

4877
03:26:30,110 --> 03:26:33,590
That player is keeping a really good eye on things~

4878
03:26:34,290 --> 03:26:39,640
Oh wait, was that the horse from before? Oh, it's a Zap!

4879
03:26:39,860 --> 03:26:48,950
I like this stage, but their team composition is really strong. I see, yeah...

4880
03:26:50,090 --> 03:26:51,570
Doesn't really suit us, huh.

4881
03:26:51,570 --> 03:26:53,530
The Liter's watching me.

4882
03:26:53,530 --> 03:26:55,070
Oh! The Liter's good too!

4883
03:26:55,070 --> 03:26:56,730
The Liter's good too!

4884
03:26:56,730 --> 03:26:58,930
Everyone's so good, huh.

4885
03:26:58,930 --> 03:27:00,650
The Liter's good too!

4886
03:27:00,650 --> 03:27:02,290
That way I got taken out was scary.

4887
03:27:02,290 --> 03:27:04,590
Nice trade!

4888
03:27:04,590 --> 03:27:06,250
The shadow changed, so—

4889
03:27:06,250 --> 03:27:07,310
I thought I could go for it,

4890
03:27:07,310 --> 03:27:08,650
but I only got one hit in.

4891
03:27:08,650 --> 03:27:11,890
This is rough, I can't get out.

4892
03:27:11,890 --> 03:27:13,930
OK, we need to

4893
03:27:13,930 --> 03:27:17,850
go apply some pressure.

4894
03:27:17,850 --> 03:27:19,850
Oh no! They're getting in so much!

4895
03:27:21,090 --> 03:27:23,090
This is bad! This is bad!

4896
03:27:23,990 --> 03:27:26,940
The Blaster is getting in so much, somehow.

4897
03:27:27,490 --> 03:27:28,590
Yes! Nice! Nice! Nice!

4898
03:27:28,590 --> 03:27:30,590
We've gotta make it work 2v1.

4899
03:27:30,590 --> 03:27:32,090
I thought we had it!

4900
03:27:32,090 --> 03:27:33,890
The enemy is just too strong.

4901
03:27:33,890 --> 03:27:35,690
They're strong.

4902
03:27:36,190 --> 03:27:39,100
But the enemy hasn't inked their base at all, so maybe—

4903
03:27:39,100 --> 03:27:39,990
There's a chance!

4904
03:27:39,990 --> 03:27:41,890
There's a chance!

4905
03:27:42,790 --> 03:27:44,790
Were they planning to do 10?

4906
03:27:46,490 --> 03:27:53,530
I wonder if the enemy will head back to ink soon or not.

4907
03:27:53,770 --> 03:27:59,160
Whoa! The Nova is insane! The Nova is so strong! For real, the Nova is crazy!

4908
03:27:59,160 --> 03:28:04,080
Heave-ho! Heave-ho! The Nova Blaster aim is super hard,

4909
03:28:04,080 --> 03:28:07,920
but if you get close enough there's a chance. Got it.

4910
03:28:07,920 --> 03:28:12,930
Peep peep.

4911
03:28:13,210 --> 03:28:18,560
Yeah, that was a bit reckless.

4912
03:28:18,560 --> 03:28:25,540
Okay.

4913
03:28:25,720 --> 03:28:30,100
Why— wait, wait, wait—

4914
03:28:30,560 --> 03:28:36,140
With the Inkjet, we're good, we're good! Nice Inkjet!

4915
03:28:36,140 --> 03:28:46,140
Yes yes yes yes yes! The enemy's ink is on our side — yeah, that's good, that's good!

4916
03:28:46,400 --> 03:28:51,680
Bam bam! We pushed through! We pushed through! Nice!

4917
03:28:53,130 --> 03:28:57,170
Amazing! Mio-chan is really good.

4918
03:28:57,170 --> 03:29:02,810
No I'm not. I always get the gold medal.

4919
03:29:02,810 --> 03:29:09,110
Well yeah, but getting the gold medal is impressive. There are times when I totally don't, so—

4920
03:29:09,110 --> 03:29:15,850
There are times when I totally don't, so the rate of getting gold medals is high for you.

4921
03:29:15,850 --> 03:29:17,850
I see, thanks.

4922
03:29:17,850 --> 03:29:19,650
Mm, no no.

4923
03:29:22,650 --> 03:29:24,650
I wonder what happened this round.

4924
03:29:24,650 --> 03:29:26,650
No no.

4925
03:29:27,450 --> 03:29:31,450
The enemy couldn't ink much, given their comp.

4926
03:29:31,450 --> 03:29:33,450
So they could get kills but that's it?

4927
03:29:33,450 --> 03:29:37,450
Yeah, since they had to keep getting kills, it might not have worked out for them.

4928
03:29:37,450 --> 03:29:39,450
But they were way too good.

4929
03:29:39,450 --> 03:29:42,450
True, it would've been better if the Zap had been inking.

4930
03:29:42,450 --> 03:29:44,450
It's tough when you're the only one.

4931
03:29:45,410 --> 03:29:47,250
Was there a Zap?

4932
03:29:49,050 --> 03:29:51,050
But it might not have fit well anyway.

4933
03:29:51,050 --> 03:29:53,050
I got taken out by the Zap once.

4934
03:29:57,450 --> 03:29:59,450
The enemy might actually be well-balanced.

4935
03:30:01,250 --> 03:30:03,250
There's only one long-range weapon.

4936
03:30:03,250 --> 03:30:04,250
Scary.

4937
03:30:05,070 --> 03:30:07,050
The rest are all short-range.

4938
03:30:07,850 --> 03:30:08,850
Korone can handle it.

4939
03:30:09,650 --> 03:30:10,650
There's a Stamp, so—

4940
03:30:11,460 --> 03:30:12,450
Watch out for the Stamp.

4941
03:30:13,250 --> 03:30:15,250
It's not just the Stamp, but I'll be careful.

4942
03:30:17,250 --> 03:30:19,250
And there's the Splatana Colab too.

4943
03:30:20,050 --> 03:30:22,050
There are bombs and stuff.

4944
03:30:23,850 --> 03:30:25,850
There are lots of roles with high adaptability.

4945
03:30:30,070 --> 03:30:30,960
Going back.

4946
03:30:30,960 --> 03:30:32,870
That's the reaction of someone who couldn't go back.

4947
03:30:35,470 --> 03:30:36,470
I'm done for.

4948
03:30:37,270 --> 03:30:38,070
This is bad, this is bad, this is bad!

4949
03:30:38,070 --> 03:30:41,070
Something long— something long— it's definitely a Jet.

4950
03:30:41,070 --> 03:30:43,090
It's definitely a Jet.

4951
03:30:43,090 --> 03:30:45,070
Definitely a Jet.

4952
03:30:45,070 --> 03:30:46,470
It's definitely a Jet.

4953
03:30:46,470 --> 03:30:47,470
It's definitely a Jet.

4954
03:30:47,470 --> 03:30:49,270
What got you?

4955
03:30:49,270 --> 03:30:50,270
A bomb.

4956
03:30:50,270 --> 03:30:51,270
What? A bomb?

4957
03:30:51,270 --> 03:30:53,870
I got taken out by a bomb.

4958
03:30:53,870 --> 03:30:56,870
No way, are you serious? Are you serious?

4959
03:30:56,870 --> 03:30:58,850
Oh, the Splattershot Collab is here!

4960
03:30:58,850 --> 03:31:00,670
Nice.

4961
03:31:00,670 --> 03:31:03,470
Nice, Flare!

4962
03:31:03,470 --> 03:31:04,470
Rolling them!

4963
03:31:04,470 --> 03:31:05,470
The enemy's down!

4964
03:31:05,470 --> 03:31:08,270
We're getting picked apart by that Dynamo.

4965
03:31:08,270 --> 03:31:09,890
Amazing, amazing!

4966
03:31:09,890 --> 03:31:11,890
That Jet Squelcher range is insane!

4967
03:31:18,700 --> 03:31:19,580
Trade!

4968
03:31:19,580 --> 03:31:21,500
Nice, it's a trade!

4969
03:31:26,630 --> 03:31:27,850
Should I fly to the Cavia side?

4970
03:31:27,850 --> 03:31:28,450
Yeah!

4971
03:31:30,330 --> 03:31:30,830
Trade!

4972
03:31:30,830 --> 03:31:33,190
Oh, sorry! I didn't have Trizooka!

4973
03:31:33,190 --> 03:31:33,950
Enemy, enemy!

4974
03:31:33,950 --> 03:31:34,950
No good?

4975
03:31:35,270 --> 03:31:36,390
Nice Bite!

4976
03:31:39,450 --> 03:31:41,450
Hmm, what should I do?

4977
03:31:43,650 --> 03:31:45,650
The left side — or is the right side open?

4978
03:31:45,650 --> 03:31:46,450
Ugh, gross!

4979
03:31:47,150 --> 03:31:51,950
I'm getting on the elevator — oh, two at once is too much.

4980
03:31:51,950 --> 03:31:57,510
Nice, got them! I think they'll come to the center soon.

4981
03:31:57,510 --> 03:32:05,780
Okay, heading to center! Heading to center!

4982
03:32:06,420 --> 03:32:09,880
Someone might be on the left — no, Manje Manje Manje Manje!

4983
03:32:09,880 --> 03:32:13,260
Ah, I fell! Sorry!

4984
03:32:13,260 --> 03:32:16,860
You fell again? Yep, I'm down over here.

4985
03:32:16,860 --> 03:32:20,120
This is bad, I need to get back fast, get back fast!

4986
03:32:20,120 --> 03:32:21,120
I need to get back fast!

4987
03:32:21,120 --> 03:32:22,680
But it's fine!

4988
03:32:22,680 --> 03:32:23,920
The ink coverage though—

4989
03:32:34,430 --> 03:32:37,200
Seriously? I only need one more hit!

4990
03:32:37,200 --> 03:32:39,000
Nice!

4991
03:32:39,000 --> 03:32:40,800
Nice!

4992
03:32:40,800 --> 03:32:42,600
I wanna jump, I wanna jump!

4993
03:32:42,600 --> 03:32:44,600
3 down! Nice!

4994
03:32:44,600 --> 03:32:46,600
There's one on the left!

4995
03:32:46,600 --> 03:32:47,410
Okay!

4996
03:32:47,410 --> 03:32:49,400
Isn't someone in the middle?

4997
03:32:56,650 --> 03:32:57,650
Oh no oh no oh no!

4998
03:32:57,650 --> 03:32:58,650
Got taken out!

4999
03:32:59,650 --> 03:33:02,450
How'd we do? Did they pull it off? Nice?

5000
03:33:02,450 --> 03:33:06,250
Didn't quite make it — needed to be a bit faster, I guess.

5001
03:33:06,250 --> 03:33:08,250
Was it no good? I thought we could've made it?

5002
03:33:08,250 --> 03:33:10,050
We went for it!

5003
03:33:10,050 --> 03:33:11,850
Nice!

5004
03:33:11,850 --> 03:33:16,450
Nice! Great shot! Great shot! Great shot!

5005
03:33:16,450 --> 03:33:18,250
Even so, I couldn't do anything there.

5006
03:33:18,250 --> 03:33:19,850
No no no!

5007
03:33:19,850 --> 03:33:22,850
Nice? Nice!

5008
03:33:27,460 --> 03:33:28,660
This is so fun!

5009
03:33:28,660 --> 03:33:30,960
So much fun!

5010
03:33:30,960 --> 03:33:32,660
That just now was something else.

5011
03:33:32,660 --> 03:33:35,020
It really feels like everyone's having a blast.

5012
03:33:35,020 --> 03:33:36,740
It really is so fun!

5013
03:33:36,740 --> 03:33:39,160
Thank you, friends, thank you!

5014
03:33:39,160 --> 03:33:40,160
Someone hit Eternal!

5015
03:33:40,160 --> 03:33:41,140
Congrats!

5016
03:33:41,140 --> 03:33:43,600
Yay!

5017
03:33:43,600 --> 03:33:44,920
Only one person isn't Eternal yet.

5018
03:33:44,920 --> 03:33:47,640
You're not gonna quit, right?

5019
03:33:47,640 --> 03:33:49,720
Still one more.

5020
03:33:49,720 --> 03:33:51,460
Not yet.

5021
03:33:51,460 --> 03:33:52,760
Not everyone's Eternal yet!

5022
03:33:52,760 --> 03:33:55,700
But Charisma is nice too, right?

5023
03:33:55,700 --> 03:33:58,160
Yeah, there are a lot of Charisma players.

5024
03:33:58,160 --> 03:34:00,920
Charisma feels fitting.

5025
03:34:00,920 --> 03:34:06,500
Eternal just feels like you've been playing for a long time, that's all.

5026
03:34:06,500 --> 03:34:07,860
Stop it, stop it!

5027
03:34:07,860 --> 03:34:08,920
It's just time played.

5028
03:34:08,920 --> 03:34:09,940
That's way too harsh!

5029
03:34:09,940 --> 03:34:14,540
The value of Eternal just dropped massively.

5030
03:34:14,540 --> 03:34:16,720
Charisma sounds like a better person somehow.

5031
03:34:16,720 --> 03:34:19,180
Charisma just looks better.

5032
03:34:19,180 --> 03:34:22,560
Let's go!

5033
03:34:22,560 --> 03:34:23,440
Oh, it's Speed!

5034
03:34:23,440 --> 03:34:26,180
I switched mine to the bath theme!

5035
03:34:26,180 --> 03:34:28,340
Oh nice, it's all shiny!

5036
03:34:28,340 --> 03:34:29,440
I went with the bath theme!

5037
03:34:29,440 --> 03:34:30,760
Someone's carrying bamboo.

5038
03:34:30,760 --> 03:34:32,340
Whoa, what's that?

5039
03:34:32,340 --> 03:34:35,300
Ugh, I don't like that.

5040
03:34:35,300 --> 03:34:36,460
Right here.

5041
03:34:36,460 --> 03:34:38,460
Wait, is that a Hokusai?

5042
03:34:38,460 --> 03:34:41,020
The white one is a Hokusai

5043
03:34:41,020 --> 03:34:42,440
That white one is crazy, that's insane

5044
03:34:42,440 --> 03:34:44,740
Is that a Shock Wunder?

5045
03:34:44,740 --> 03:34:46,840
A regular Hokusai

5046
03:34:46,840 --> 03:34:48,840
that just got a little fancier

5047
03:34:48,840 --> 03:34:49,620
just turned white

5048
03:34:49,620 --> 03:34:55,980
That's wild though

5049
03:34:55,980 --> 03:34:57,780
Isn't that the Inkbrush?

5050
03:34:57,780 --> 03:34:59,520
The Inkbrush?

5051
03:34:59,880 --> 03:35:00,760
Order Brush

5052
03:35:00,760 --> 03:35:03,340
Ow, what are they doing to me

5053
03:35:03,340 --> 03:35:06,000
Order Brush trade!

5054
03:35:06,000 --> 03:35:07,120
So it's called the Order Brush

5055
03:35:07,120 --> 03:35:11,070
It has a long range

5056
03:35:17,430 --> 03:35:18,790
Well, not that long I guess

5057
03:35:18,790 --> 03:35:19,810
Is that a Gal?

5058
03:35:19,810 --> 03:35:23,460
The Gal has long range, but

5059
03:35:23,460 --> 03:35:25,410
compared to a roller it's long

5060
03:35:25,410 --> 03:35:27,010
Right, yeah

5061
03:35:27,010 --> 03:35:30,800
Exactly

5062
03:35:30,800 --> 03:35:34,210
Not a Splatling — that thing is annoying

5063
03:35:34,210 --> 03:35:36,010
Which one?

5064
03:35:36,010 --> 03:35:38,010
The Squeezer

5065
03:35:38,010 --> 03:35:39,810
Yeah, right?

5066
03:35:41,750 --> 03:35:43,550
The Squeezer or something like that

5067
03:35:43,550 --> 03:35:45,550
