A Gal is coming into our base!

5613
03:59:06,700 --> 03:59:07,040
Mio-senpai, you're fine!

5614
03:59:07,040 --> 03:59:08,160
Mio-senpai is fine!

5615
03:59:08,160 --> 03:59:08,860
I'm fine!

5616
03:59:08,860 --> 03:59:12,400
This is bad, this is bad!

5617
03:59:12,400 --> 03:59:14,440
Ah! Sorry! That's impossible!

5618
03:59:14,440 --> 03:59:17,240
There are already two of them in the center...

5619
03:59:17,240 --> 03:59:20,040
There's one over here too, this is bad!

5620
03:59:20,040 --> 03:59:22,160
This is bad, we've been getting bomb-rolled this whole time!

5621
03:59:22,160 --> 03:59:23,500
This is bad, so frustrating!

5622
03:59:23,500 --> 03:59:25,000
So frustrating!

5623
03:59:25,000 --> 03:59:26,460
So frustrating!

5624
03:59:26,460 --> 03:59:27,440
Heave-ho!

5625
03:59:27,440 --> 03:59:29,200
No, that... is that impossible?

5626
03:59:29,200 --> 03:59:30,960
Damn!

5627
03:59:30,960 --> 03:59:31,640
Oh, you scared me — that was a teammate's bomb!

5628
03:59:31,640 --> 03:59:33,640
I want to show them what we've got though...

5629
03:59:33,640 --> 03:59:34,160
Ugh...

5630
03:59:34,160 --> 03:59:37,860
The middle... we keep losing it.

5631
03:59:37,860 --> 03:59:40,860
Man, this is rough. What's raining down from above?! Man, this is rough!

5632
03:59:40,860 --> 03:59:45,460
They keep doing the bomb thing — oh no, I'm gonna die!

5633
03:59:45,460 --> 03:59:50,060
This is bad, they're taking the ground under us!

5634
03:59:50,060 --> 03:59:55,860
The Megaphone Laser is insane! The middle is insane! We keep dying in the middle!

5635
03:59:55,860 --> 04:00:01,460
Okay, let's all just go together! Alright!

5636
04:00:01,460 --> 04:00:05,070
Let's go together! My special is charged!

5637
04:00:05,070 --> 04:00:07,060
Oh, yours is charged too!

5638
04:00:11,790 --> 04:00:15,790
Nananananananananana!

5639
04:00:16,590 --> 04:00:17,590
Okay okay okay!

5640
04:00:18,390 --> 04:00:19,390
The middle!

5641
04:00:21,190 --> 04:00:23,190
Nice! Nice nice!

5642
04:00:23,190 --> 04:00:24,190
This is bad, this is bad!

5643
04:00:25,260 --> 04:00:27,260
Ugh!

5644
04:00:28,780 --> 04:00:33,620
We might be done, we might be done, we might be done!

5645
04:00:33,620 --> 04:00:35,380
The end was good though!

5646
04:00:35,380 --> 04:00:37,380
Wait, we might've made it?

5647
04:00:37,380 --> 04:00:39,180
That was pretty close, right?

5648
04:00:39,180 --> 04:00:40,980
Nice!!

5649
04:00:40,980 --> 04:00:46,920
Amazing!

5650
04:00:46,920 --> 04:00:48,920
Pushing forward was the right call!

5651
04:00:48,920 --> 04:00:51,930
Also, the Tenta Missiles were so clean, I was shocked!

5652
04:00:51,930 --> 04:00:53,930
Nice!

5653
04:00:53,930 --> 04:00:55,910
Fist bump!

5654
04:00:55,910 --> 04:01:03,550
So we won the 110x battle!

5655
04:01:03,550 --> 04:01:05,350
Yes!!

5656
04:01:05,350 --> 04:01:07,150
I'm so happy we won the 10x!

5657
04:01:07,150 --> 04:01:09,150
So happy!

5658
04:01:09,150 --> 04:01:10,950
Mio-chan, what do you want to do?

5659
04:01:10,950 --> 04:01:12,950
It's 2 o'clock though.

5660
04:01:12,950 --> 04:01:14,750
By the way, I just need one more win—

5661
04:01:14,750 --> 04:01:16,750
—and I'll probably go Eternal.

5662
04:01:16,750 --> 04:01:18,750
Then let's do one more!

5663
04:01:18,750 --> 04:01:20,750
Yeah, let's do it!

5664
04:01:20,750 --> 04:01:22,550
I want to win one more!

5665
04:01:22,550 --> 04:01:24,550
If we win one more—

5666
04:01:24,550 --> 04:01:26,550
—I'll go Eternal!

5667
04:01:26,550 --> 04:01:28,150
Wonderful!

5668
04:01:28,150 --> 04:01:30,150
What if we lose though?

5669
04:01:30,150 --> 04:01:32,150
Well...

5670
04:01:32,150 --> 04:01:34,150
But we're on a huge win streak right now!

5671
04:01:34,150 --> 04:01:36,050
It's crazy, right? It's crazy!

5672
04:01:36,050 --> 04:01:37,950
But the opponents will be on a win streak too—

5673
04:01:37,950 --> 04:01:43,010
—we'll get matched against a team that's been winning a ton.

5674
04:01:43,010 --> 04:01:46,410
That last team was pretty strong too, I think.

5675
04:01:46,410 --> 04:01:49,270
Yeah, it was rough — I really couldn't push forward at all.

5676
04:01:49,270 --> 04:01:51,750
Right.

5677
04:01:51,750 --> 04:01:55,090
Okay, let's grab the Negi!

5678
04:01:55,090 --> 04:02:00,160
Let's grab the Negi, let's go!

5679
04:02:03,760 --> 04:02:05,760
Just for a moment, just for a moment!

5680
04:02:05,760 --> 04:02:07,140
For a moment there, it was looking sketchy!

5681
04:02:07,140 --> 04:02:07,640
Yeah

5682
04:02:09,520 --> 04:02:10,020
It's fine

5683
04:02:10,020 --> 04:02:11,460
There's a Barrel Spinner

5684
04:02:11,460 --> 04:02:13,040
It's fine, the enemy's on a 4-loss streak

5685
04:02:13,040 --> 04:02:14,000
Four in a row!

5686
04:02:14,000 --> 04:02:14,500
Okay

5687
04:02:17,530 --> 04:02:19,770
What's even the point of this streak?

5688
04:02:20,310 --> 04:02:21,610
What difference does it make?

5689
04:02:21,610 --> 04:02:24,610
It just means we're doing that much better than them

5690
04:02:27,130 --> 04:02:29,030
Earlier it felt a little close though

5691
04:02:29,030 --> 04:02:30,290
They're already here, that was fast

5692
04:02:33,060 --> 04:02:33,720
So fast!

5693
04:02:33,940 --> 04:02:34,980
Don't get cocky!

5694
04:02:35,200 --> 04:02:36,500
Nice!

5695
04:02:36,500 --> 04:02:37,500
Nice?

5696
04:02:37,500 --> 04:02:38,500
Nice?

5697
04:02:42,260 --> 04:02:45,060
Could you please stop that?

5698
04:02:53,870 --> 04:02:54,370
Nice!

5699
04:02:54,370 --> 04:02:55,370
Did someone fall?

5700
04:02:55,370 --> 04:02:56,370
Nice! Nice!

5701
04:02:56,370 --> 04:02:56,870
Nice shot!

5702
04:02:56,870 --> 04:02:57,870
Good, good, good!

5703
04:02:57,870 --> 04:02:58,870
Wai- wai- wai-

5704
04:02:58,870 --> 04:03:01,870
They keep pushing in again and again!

5705
04:03:01,870 --> 04:03:02,870
Okay!

5706
04:03:02,870 --> 04:03:03,870
This side is better

5707
04:03:03,870 --> 04:03:05,760
Then I'll push in from here too

5708
04:03:05,760 --> 04:03:08,940
Nice, go in, go in!

5709
04:03:08,940 --> 04:03:11,780
Nice— couldn't do it!

5710
04:03:11,780 --> 04:03:15,540
Now, they're coming now — the N-ZAP is coming!

5711
04:03:15,540 --> 04:03:18,340
N-ZAP? Who? Who? Who?

5712
04:03:18,340 --> 04:03:20,340
N-ZAP? The N-ZAP is coming!

5713
04:03:20,340 --> 04:03:22,340
N-ZAP? Knapsack?

5714
04:03:22,340 --> 04:03:24,180
Knapsack, yeah

5715
04:03:24,180 --> 04:03:26,940
Nice, nice, nice!

5716
04:03:27,740 --> 04:03:30,540
IRyS, nice, nice!

5717
04:03:30,540 --> 04:03:33,540
Good job, IRyS! Splat, IRyS!

5718
04:03:35,160 --> 04:03:37,160
Go, go, go!

5719
04:03:39,960 --> 04:03:41,760
Whoa, they got there

5720
04:03:42,670 --> 04:03:44,560
Got hit by a Tenta Missiles

5721
04:03:45,360 --> 04:03:46,360
Enemy down 3?

5722
04:03:47,160 --> 04:03:48,160
Nice, down 3?

5723
04:03:48,160 --> 04:03:49,160
Nice, 3 down!

5724
04:03:49,160 --> 04:03:50,160
I'm disrupting them right now

5725
04:03:50,160 --> 04:03:51,960
Ugh, got splatted by a Splatana Stamper, sorry

5726
04:03:55,220 --> 04:03:56,220
This side is similar

5727
04:03:57,020 --> 04:03:58,020
I'm disrupting but did I die?

5728
04:03:58,020 --> 04:03:58,820
Sorry, I died

5729
04:03:58,820 --> 04:03:59,820
Nice

5730
04:03:59,820 --> 04:04:01,620
We're down 2 on this side

5731
04:04:02,420 --> 04:04:03,330
Okay!

5732
04:04:03,330 --> 04:04:05,020
Heading this way!

5733
04:04:05,020 --> 04:04:06,020
Ugh, I could only do so much

5734
04:04:06,020 --> 04:04:07,020
Oh no

5735
04:04:09,410 --> 04:04:10,210
Got one!

5736
04:04:10,210 --> 04:04:11,210
Whoa!

5737
04:04:11,210 --> 04:04:12,210
Nice

5738
04:04:16,830 --> 04:04:18,830
Watch out, there are 2 of them

5739
04:04:18,830 --> 04:04:19,630
Yes, got one!

5740
04:04:19,630 --> 04:04:20,630
Nice, nice!

5741
04:04:22,570 --> 04:04:24,530
The N-ZAP is climbing up

5742
04:04:24,530 --> 04:04:25,370
On the right

5743
04:04:25,370 --> 04:04:26,170
Oh, you're right

5744
04:04:26,170 --> 04:04:26,970
They're climbing up

5745
04:04:26,970 --> 04:04:29,860
I just died so I'll go deal with it

5746
04:04:29,860 --> 04:04:30,740
Okay

5747
04:04:30,740 --> 04:04:31,570
Here we go

5748
04:04:31,570 --> 04:04:32,570
Ugh, sorry, couldn't get them

5749
04:04:32,570 --> 04:04:33,570
There's an N-ZAP here

5750
04:04:33,570 --> 04:04:35,370
Oh wait, N-ZAP? N-ZAP?

5751
04:04:35,370 --> 04:04:37,370
N-ZAP

5752
04:04:37,370 --> 04:04:39,370
What even is an N-ZAP?

5753
04:04:39,370 --> 04:04:41,170
Someone's down

5754
04:04:41,170 --> 04:04:43,170
Our teammates are down too, might be a bit dangerous

5755
04:04:43,170 --> 04:04:44,990
Ultra Stamp, stop the Ultra Stamp!

5756
04:04:46,970 --> 04:04:48,970
Ultra Stamp coming in from the right

5757
04:04:48,970 --> 04:04:50,770
This is bad!

5758
04:04:50,770 --> 04:04:52,750
The Stamp came down and moved to the left

5759
04:04:52,750 --> 04:04:54,370
Okay, nice!

5760
04:04:54,370 --> 04:04:56,370
Carbonara took care of it!

5761
04:04:56,370 --> 04:04:58,370
The earthquake is crazy

5762
04:04:58,370 --> 04:05:00,170
Yeah, this is bad

5763
04:05:02,110 --> 04:05:04,110
Did we fail?

5764
04:05:06,400 --> 04:05:08,400
Not sure yet, not sure yet

5765
04:05:08,400 --> 04:05:09,400
Still not sure — we didn't make it

5766
04:05:13,000 --> 04:05:14,000
What about after the wipeout?

5767
04:05:14,000 --> 04:05:16,000
Right at the wipeout, at the very end

5768
04:05:16,000 --> 04:05:17,000
Yeah

5769
04:05:17,000 --> 04:05:18,000
We made it! We made it!

5770
04:05:18,000 --> 04:05:19,000
We made it! We made it!

5771
04:05:19,000 --> 04:05:20,000
Are we good? We're good!

5772
04:05:20,800 --> 04:05:21,800
Let's go!

5773
04:05:21,800 --> 04:05:22,800
Nice!

5774
04:05:23,730 --> 04:05:25,400
We did it!

5775
04:05:25,400 --> 04:05:26,400
Nice!

5776
04:05:29,230 --> 04:05:30,230
Nice! Nice!

5777
04:05:30,030 --> 04:05:32,590
Ta-da-da-da-da-da-dun~

5778
04:05:32,590 --> 04:05:36,590
Yay! We did it! That was so clutch!

5779
04:05:36,590 --> 04:05:40,590
We ranked up! We ranked up! Did we go up? Did we?

5780
04:05:40,590 --> 04:05:45,590
We went up... wait, did we? Can we tell from this?

5781
04:05:45,590 --> 04:05:52,590
So we ranked up? We did! Yay!

5782
04:05:52,590 --> 04:05:55,590
We did it! Should we wrap up?

5783
04:05:55,590 --> 04:05:58,710
Should we call it here? We won, after all!

5784
04:05:58,500 --> 04:06:00,300
Yeah, that feels great

5785
04:06:00,300 --> 04:06:01,740
Let's do it

5786
04:06:01,740 --> 04:06:05,440
That was so fun — I'm so happy we got to play as a full squad

5787
04:06:05,440 --> 04:06:07,100
That was a blast

5788
04:06:07,100 --> 04:06:08,200
For real

5789
04:06:08,200 --> 04:06:10,140
It felt so good

5790
04:06:10,140 --> 04:06:11,520
It really did feel amazing

5791
04:06:11,520 --> 04:06:15,120
That final 6-win streak though — six in a row!

5792
04:06:15,120 --> 04:06:16,280
Six wins is insane

5793
04:06:16,280 --> 04:06:17,580
That felt so good

5794
04:06:17,580 --> 04:06:19,000
Six in a row just feels amazing

5795
04:06:19,000 --> 04:06:20,400
That was the best

5796
04:06:20,400 --> 04:06:22,020
Thank you so much

5797
04:06:22,020 --> 04:06:26,460
I don't know if we'll get another chance, but let's do this again

5798
04:06:26,460 --> 04:06:29,780
Hope we can do it again

5799
04:06:29,780 --> 04:06:30,940
Let's play again

5800
04:06:30,940 --> 04:06:34,280
Thank you so much

5801
04:06:34,280 --> 04:06:36,180
Thank you!

5802
04:06:36,180 --> 04:06:39,880
Good night!

5803
04:06:39,680 --> 04:06:41,680
Good night~!

5804
04:06:55,350 --> 04:06:58,830
I'm so glad we won at the end

5805
04:06:58,830 --> 04:07:00,790
That 5-win streak at the end, and then at the very start...

5806
04:07:00,790 --> 04:07:02,030
What?

5807
04:07:02,030 --> 04:07:06,810
The first hour we were just getting stomped the whole time

5808
04:07:06,810 --> 04:07:10,550
Seriously, for real

5809
04:07:10,550 --> 04:07:12,910
Good work, everyone

5810
04:07:12,910 --> 04:07:14,330
Thanks for the paint spread!

5811
04:07:14,330 --> 04:07:19,530
Thank you for playing with me from morning all the way to night today

5812
04:07:19,530 --> 04:07:21,070
That was so fun

5813
04:07:21,070 --> 04:07:23,190
Genuinely so fun

5814
04:07:23,190 --> 04:07:25,990
Right?

5815
04:07:25,990 --> 04:07:27,550
Your roller play was incredible

5816
04:07:27,550 --> 04:07:28,790
No it wasn't, come on

5817
04:07:28,790 --> 04:07:30,110
I'm really not that good, guys

5818
04:07:30,110 --> 04:07:36,330
Everyone says I'm good, but my startup is a bit slow

5819
04:07:36,330 --> 04:07:41,550
Yeah, the startup... anyway, thanks for the points

5820
04:07:41,550 --> 04:07:47,110
Getting 100x was so hype — I took a screenshot of it

5821
04:07:47,110 --> 04:07:51,510
I'll post it on Twitter

5822
04:07:51,510 --> 04:07:56,710
We won the Splatfest too! Thank you, thank you! Yay!

5823
04:07:56,710 --> 04:08:02,190
Ahh, I'm so happy! Please don't call me No-Mi, okay~

5824
04:08:02,190 --> 04:08:07,430
Yeah, slow starter... but man, I really wanted to hit that 333x

5825
04:08:07,430 --> 04:08:12,870
So tomorrow — well, the date already changed so it's today — I can't play today

5826
04:08:12,870 --> 04:08:19,090
I have recordings, so when I do have time to play, I want to make the most of it

5827
04:08:19,090 --> 04:08:25,210
Streams like this — some of us can stream and some can't, so the schedule's a bit scattered

5828
04:08:25,210 --> 04:08:31,710
Sorry for dragging everyone around — just hang in there a little longer

5829
04:08:31,710 --> 04:08:39,250
I have work tomorrow! But I want to do ranked again — Ranked Battle

5830
04:08:39,250 --> 04:08:49,250
Hmm, I don't really want to do Clam Blitz or Rainmaker... I just want to do Splat Zones — like, only play Zones for 2 hours

5831
04:08:49,250 --> 04:08:54,670
That'd be nice. Is there like a schedule somewhere?

5832
04:08:54,670 --> 04:08:58,410
Thanks for the fun time! No, thank you!

5833
04:08:58,410 --> 04:09:07,150
Splat Zones is the easiest to understand — you don't have to think too much

5834
04:09:07,150 --> 04:09:11,990
Like, with Rainmaker you have to think about carrying it and stuff

5835
04:09:11,990 --> 04:09:14,750
Like, nobody's holding it — should I pick it up?

5836
04:09:14,750 --> 04:09:21,610
And with Clam Blitz you're thinking about whether to group the clams together...

5837
04:09:21,610 --> 04:09:26,790
There's a lot to think about, but Zones is just — take the zone, that's it

5838
04:09:26,790 --> 04:09:32,450
The official app? Got it, everyone

5839
04:09:32,450 --> 04:09:40,290
I wonder if most of you have tomorrow off? Sunday, so probably a lot of people are off

5840
04:09:40,290 --> 04:09:44,190
Yeah, thank you so much

5841
04:09:44,190 --> 04:09:47,110
Thank you so much!

5842
04:09:47,190 --> 04:09:52,550
But you know, I also love the sound of picking up clams and stuff.

5843
04:09:52,550 --> 04:09:59,910
Good night! What are you up to? Good luck at work tomorrow!

5844
04:09:59,910 --> 04:10:08,270
Going to the movies sounds nice! Be careful on your way out — I think it might rain tomorrow. Let me check the forecast.

5845
04:10:08,270 --> 04:10:11,480
Hmm, let me see...

5846
04:10:11,640 --> 04:10:14,720
Rain, huh.

5847
04:10:14,860 --> 04:10:21,300
Looks like it might rain a little here and there. It's hot — already 30 degrees!

5848
04:10:21,300 --> 04:10:25,460
Be careful during the day — it's really hot out there.

5849
04:10:27,380 --> 04:10:32,150
Take care! Oh, going to an art museum? That sounds lovely!

5850
04:10:32,570 --> 04:10:37,490
I think Korone will be taking tomorrow off, so everyone, as for Korone's stream...

5851
04:10:37,490 --> 04:10:44,290
Will there be one? If there is, I'll let you know — so go ahead and head out, it'll be fine!

5852
04:10:47,660 --> 04:10:56,140
Making curry sounds great! Are you making it from scratch with spices, or using a powder mix?

5853
04:10:56,140 --> 04:11:00,900
Get some good rest! It really is the middle of summer, huh.

5854
04:11:00,900 --> 04:11:06,460
"Watching Gargoyle" "No guerrilla stream" — Yeah, I probably won't do one tomorrow.

5855
04:11:06,460 --> 04:11:11,860
Hmm, probably not tomorrow.

5856
04:11:12,420 --> 04:11:19,220
"You need to drink lots of water." Right, even today while playing Splatoon I drank about three bottles.

5857
04:11:19,220 --> 04:11:22,380
Just during the evening — wait, no.

5858
04:11:22,380 --> 04:11:27,060
If I count the morning, that's four. Or was it three in the morning?

5859
04:11:27,060 --> 04:11:35,140
No wait — two in the morning, two during the afternoon stream, and two just now.

5860
04:11:35,140 --> 04:11:38,180
Yeah.

5861
04:11:38,540 --> 04:11:43,100
That was so fun! Hey, everyone — was the audio balance okay?

5862
04:11:43,100 --> 04:11:49,020
I know it's a bit late to ask now, after streaming this long... but at the very beginning,

5863
04:11:49,020 --> 04:11:55,680
I turned up IRyS's voice a bit, and the others' voices a bit too.

5864
04:11:55,680 --> 04:12:01,280
Oh, it was fine? And I turned up the game audio a little too. Was that okay?

5865
04:12:01,280 --> 04:12:06,820
It was fine? Great. If it wasn't, you all would've said something, right?

5866
04:12:06,820 --> 04:12:10,420
You would've said something if it was fine — I mean, if it wasn't!

5867
04:12:10,420 --> 04:12:20,420
I figured if it was hard to watch, you'd probably say something when the match ended and Korone was reading chat,

5868
04:12:23,020 --> 04:12:28,630
like "Koro-san, the volume is a bit..." — you'd tell me, right?

5869
